pan></div></div></div></form></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div></div><div class="header"><div class="fixedlayer"><div class="header-container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><div class="d-flex align-items-center"><a class="header-logo-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com"><img style="height: 30px" class="logo d-block" src="/static/index/img/logo.svg" alt="AiPrice logo"></a><!--<h5 class="header-secondly-logo">Blog</h5>--></div><div class="header-menu"><nav class="nav"><a class="menu-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/independent/taobao.html"><span class="menu-text">Blog Home</span></a></nav></div><div class="header-buttons"><a class="menu-link-btn btn-outline-grey register_btn"><span class="menu-text">Sign Up</span></a><a class="menu-link-btn btn-outline-orange login_btn" ><span class="menu-text">Log In</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="canvasBox" style="display: none;"><canvas id="demoCanvas"></canvas></div><!--多语言错误提示 有待完善--><input type="hidden" id="image_type_error" value="Accepted Formats:.jpeg  .jpg .gif and .png"><input type="hidden" id="error_upload_size" value="Image size must not exceed 500KB"><main class="unit-wrapper bg-white"><section class="section-container py-4"><div class="article-main"><div class="article-detail"><section class="article pb-5"><figure class="mb-5"><img class="w-100" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/thumb/o/agent68c7e76aceddd.png" alt="Aliprice"></figure><h1 class="article-detail-title mb-5">AiPrice (formerly AliPrice) Sourcing Tool</h1><div class="article-lable justify-content-center mb-5"><a class="text-blue" href="https://www.aiprice.com/independent/taobao.html">Home</a><span class="grey-line">/</span><a class="text-blue" href="https://www.aiprice.com/en/taobao_tutorials/459/Others">Others</a><span class="grey-line">/</span><span class="text-grey">AiPrice (formerly AliPrice) Sourcing Tool</span></div><div class="article-detail-content mb-5"><p><strong>AiPrice (formerly AiPrice) Sourcing Tool</strong> belongs to <span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ">Dongguan Chengpai Network Technology Co., Ltd.</span>&nbsp;It is a one-click image search and product sourcing tool specially designed for cross-border e-commerce sellers.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. Introduction to AiPrice</strong></p><p>AiPrice is a company focused on the development and operation of cross-border e-commerce SaaS software.</p><p>As of <strong>August 2025</strong>, AiPrice has over <strong>1 million total users</strong>, with nearly <strong>650,000 registered users</strong>. Its website ranks about <strong>20,000</strong> globally on Alexa, and around <strong>1,000</strong> in South Korea. Over <strong>70% of local merchants in South Korea</strong> choose the AiPrice extension, demonstrating its strong influence and popularity in the international market.</p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7d7f52ac23.png" title="agent68c7d7f52ac23.png" alt="agent68c7d7f52ac23.png"/></p><p><strong>2. Core Features</strong></p><p><strong>Image Search for Same Products</strong> across multiple e-commerce platforms including 1688, Taobao, Alibaba, Amazon, AliExpress, Shopee, SHEIN, Ozon, Naver Shopping, eBay, Pinduoduo, Google Lens, Soukuan, Yandex, Wildberries, Domeggook, Coupang, Netsea, Ownerclan, Onch3, Mercari, etc.</p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbbdb1e9a.png" title="agent68c7dbbdb1e9a.png" alt="agent68c7dbbdb1e9a.png"/></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbc6c9faf.png" title="agent68c7dbc6c9faf.png" alt="agent68c7dbc6c9faf.png"/></p><p><strong>Product Price History Tracking.</strong></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbd5439a3.png" title="agent68c7dbd5439a3.png" alt="agent68c7dbd5439a3.png"/></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbde8a235.png" title="agent68c7dbde8a235.png" alt="agent68c7dbde8a235.png"/></p><p><strong>Product Collection and Export Functions.</strong></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbed91980.png" title="agent68c7dbed91980.png" alt="agent68c7dbed91980.png"/></p><p><strong>One-stop Product Sourcing and Operation Services</strong>, helping cross-border sellers improve sourcing and listing efficiency.</p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dbf7b3d44.png" title="agent68c7dbf7b3d44.png" alt="agent68c7dbf7b3d44.png"/></p><p><strong>3. Use Cases</strong></p><p><strong>Image Search</strong>: One-click search for identical products, helping users find cheaper sources across multiple platforms (such as 1688, Taobao, Alibaba, AliExpress, etc.), discover untapped market opportunities, and create potential bestsellers.</p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dc0c582bb.png" title="agent68c7dc0c582bb.png" alt="agent68c7dc0c582bb.png"/></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"></span></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Price Comparison</strong>: Quickly compare the same product’s prices across different stores/platforms to find the best procurement channel; also calculate profit margins based on market prices to support pricing strategies.</span></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dc17dd711.png" title="agent68c7dc17dd711.png" alt="agent68c7dc17dd711.png"/></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Price History Tracking</strong>: View 3-month, 6-month, or 1-year historical price records to identify real discounts; track product prices and receive notifications when prices drop/rise, with email alerts supported.</span></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dc23f405b.png" title="agent68c7dc23f405b.png" alt="agent68c7dc23f405b.png"/></span></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"><strong>Product Collection and Export</strong>: Supports bulk export of product information (such as titles, images, links, prices, etc.); capture real-time product details and sales data from the current page for easier listing or comparative analysis.</span><br/></p><p><img class="lazy" src="https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/article/o/agent68c7dc34ee07e.png" title="agent68c7dc34ee07e.png" alt="agent68c7dc34ee07e.png"/></p><p><strong>4. Target Users</strong></p><p><span style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"></span></p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p><strong>Cross-border sellers</strong>: Search for identical products to find suppliers, compare prices, and optimize listings.</p></li><li><p><strong>Agents/Buyers</strong>: Monitor price trends to identify the lowest prices and high-quality supply channels.</p></li><li><p><strong>End consumers</strong>: Compare prices, check historical prices, and avoid overpaying.</p></li></ul><p><br/></p><p><strong>5. Supported Languages, Platforms, and Browsers</strong></p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p><strong>Website</strong>: <a target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="http://www.aliprice.com">www.aliprice.com<span class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"></span></a></p></li><li><p><strong>Languages</strong>: Chinese, English, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, French, German, Polish, Italian, Turkish, Arabic, Hebrew, Thai, Vietnamese</p></li><li><p><strong>Browsers</strong>: Chrome, Edge, Quark, 360 Speed X, 360 Secure, 360 AI, QQ Browser, Sogou, Yandex, AdsPower, Purple Bird, Opera, Maxthon, 2345, etc.</p></li><li><p><strong>Platforms</strong>: 1688, Taobao, Alibaba, Amazon, AliExpress, Shopee, SHEIN, Ozon, Naver Shopping, eBay, Pinduoduo, Google Lens, Soukuan, Yandex, Wildberries, Domeggook, Coupang, Netsea, Ownerclan, Onch3, Mercari, etc.</p></li></ul><p><br/></p><p><strong>6. AiPrice Development History</strong></p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p><strong>July 2013</strong> – Established the studio.</p></li><li><p><strong>December 2014</strong> – Founded Dongguan Chengpai Network Technology Co., Ltd.</p></li><li><p><strong>2018</strong> – Awarded the title of High-Tech Enterprise in Dongguan.</p></li><li><p><strong>November 2023</strong> – Honored as one of the first official partners of 1688 Cross-Border E-commerce.</p></li><li><p><strong>December 2023</strong> – Became an official 1688 cross-border service provider.</p></li><li><p><strong>August 2025</strong> – Awarded the 2025 WorldFirst New Momentum Partner.</p></li></ul><p><br/></p><p>For more detailed feature introductions, please check: <a href="https://www.aliprice.com/taobao_tutorials/667_425/Introduction-of-AiPrice-Shopping-Assistant-for-1688" target="_blank"><strong>1688 Extension Introduction</strong></a></p><p>If you have any questions, feel free to <a href="https://www.aliprice.com/information/index/page/contact?t=list" target="_blank">leave a message</a> anytime!</p><p><br/></p><p><br style="text-wrap-mode: wrap;"/></p><p><br/></p></div><div class="article-share d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center"><a class="article-share-item article-share-item-facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aiprice.com%2Fen%2F%24tutorials%2F2493_459%2Flanguage%2Fenglish" target="_blank"><i class="ap-icon icon-facebook"></i></a><a class="article-share-item article-share-item-vk" href="https://vk.com/share.php?url={https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aiprice.com%2FarticleDetails.html%3Flanguage%3Denglish%26acticle_id%3D2493%26category_id%3D459&image=https://statichk.aiprice.com/agent/thumb/o/agent68c7e76aceddd.png&title=AiPrice (formerly AliPrice) Sourcing Tool" target="_blank"><i class="ap-icon icon-vk"></i></a><a class="article-share-item article-share-item-twitter" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aiprice.